  "description": "APPLICATION FOR A LAWFUL DEVELOPMENT CERTIFICATE IN RESPECT OF THE PROPOSED INSTALLATION OF A 6.12 KWP ROOF-MOUNTED SOLAR PHOTOVOLTAIC\r\n(PV) SYSTEM ON THE EXISTING FLAT ROOF OF THE BUILDING. THE WORKS INCLUDE THE\r\nINSTALLATION OF 12 SOLAR PV PANELS MOUNTED ON A PROPRIETARY ROOF MOUNTING\r\nSYSTEM, TOGETHER WITH ASSOCIATED SUPPORT FRAMES. ASSOCIATED WORKS INCLUDE THE\r\nINSTALLATION OF INVERTER EQUIPMENT, ISOLATORS, ELECTRICAL CABLING, GENERATION\r\nMETERING AND CONNECTION TO THE BUILDING'S EXISTING ELECTRICAL SUPPLY. THE WORKS\r\nALSO INCLUDE ALL ANCILLARY ELECTRICAL AND COMMISSIONING WORKS NECESSARY TO\r\nBRING THE INSTALLATION INTO OPERATION.",
